<title>UK: World Bank to launch 750 mln stg five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank to launch 750 mln stg five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank will shortly launch a 750 million stg five-year Eurobond at a spread of around two basis points over British government bonds, lead manager BZW said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
